da .$\n\nFirst, notice that \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\text{Re}(\\lambda ) & \\text{Im}(\\lambda ) \\\\ -\\text{Im}(\\lambda ) & \\text{Re}(\\lambda )\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}]=C.\n$$\n\nNext, we can find the real and imaginary parts of our eigenvector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =[\\begin{aligned}-\\text{i} \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]={{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Re}(v)}+\\text{i}{{[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Im}(v)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can now construct $P:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P & =[\\begin{aligned}| & | \\\\ \\text{Re}(v) & \\text{Im}(v) \\\\ | & |\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14071601/state.json" "file_sha256" "810646eb602bf82225fb1fc6de7d72e6a4b9ce87ad8ea9dbaa64046422b261e8"} {"question" "q-38557" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14071601/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7166ee5fdb9a55a873b7fd8244d7357cc9a484e35e7df5db86fc0dfeea5b7d52"} {"question" "q-38557" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14071601/state.json" "file_sha256" "810646eb602bf82225fb1fc6de7d72e6a4b9ce87ad8ea9dbaa64046422b261e8"} {"question" "q-38557" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligne